# Config for `act` (https://github.com/nektos/act), which replays .github/workflows/*.yml
# locally in Docker. Run from inside the devcontainer (its docker-in-docker feature supplies
# the daemon `act` needs) via: act -W .github/workflows/design-system-ci.yml pull_request
#
# GitHub's ubuntu-latest hosted runner has far more preinstalled tooling than act's default
# minimal image, and this repo's CI relies on some of it (corepack, actions/setup-node's
# caching). catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest is the closest published equivalent — using the
# default image here would fail on missing tools that have nothing to do with this repo's
# actual gates.
-P ubuntu-latest=catthehacker/ubuntu:act-latest
